description: Removes the TODO(slug) code comments of TODO.md entries ruled delete before the todo-triage tool prunes them, rewriting what a comment also says about the code. Stages its edits; never commits.
tools: [Read, Write, Edit, Grep, Glob, Bash]
codex_sandbox: workspace-write
